          "line": 9,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.bs/windows/cd.md#L9"
        },
        {
          "description": "Pokaži put trenutnog radnog direktorija:",
          "command": "cd",
          "line": 13,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.bs/windows/cd.md#L13"
        },
        {
          "description": "Idi u specifični direktorij na istom pogonu:",
          "command": "cd {{put\\do\\datoteke}}",
          "line": 17,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.bs/windows/cd.md#L17"
        },
        {
          "description": "Idi u specifični direktorij na drugom pogonu:",
          "command": "cd /d {{C}}:{{put\\do\\datoteke}}",
          "line": 21,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.bs/windows/cd.md#L21"
        },
        {
          "description": "Idi u roditeljski direktorij trenutnog direktorija:",
          "command": "cd ..",
          "line": 25,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.bs/windows/cd.md#L25"
        },
        {
